  dialogues:
  - speaker: 0
    text: When the lights come back on, the two corpses have fused together.
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: "You feel there\u2019s no way to separate them now."
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: "\u201CThat was terrifying\u2026 where did you go when the power went out?\u201D"
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: Christina looks genuinely rattled.
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: "\u201CI was in the other corner. Guess we\u2019re lucky to still be alive.\u201D"
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: "\u201CYeah\u2026 fine.\u201D"
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: "\u201CAre you still able to assist?\u201D"
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: "\u201CI\u2019m not taking another step closer.\u201D"
